    "notes": [
      "Requires xdm_android_uix_r5_activity_settings_developer_boundary_overlay.zip as its direct baseline.",
      "Adds stable semantics tags for the adaptive shell and every primary user workflow, plus 48 dp minimum interaction targets and explicit state descriptions.",
      "Qualifies shared headers, metrics, long names, empty/error states, and Add modal behavior at 200 percent font scale across Compact, Medium, and Expanded windows.",
      "Preserves transient route, filter, organization, media, library, and Add state through rotation where appropriate.",
      "Expensive developer planners compose only when persisted Developer options are enabled and the Developer tools panel is active.",
      "Normal user UI is statically prohibited from exposing internal architecture phrases, raw machine values, full secret-bearing URLs, cookies, authorization values, and command templates.",
      "Devtool validation expands to debug and beta lint, module and app tests, Android-test assembly, debug/beta packaging, and zero warnings/errors.",
      "Room schema 14, versionName 0.20.0-rc08, versionCode 21, six internal routes, five visible destinations, engines, queue behavior, recovery, and external handoff remain unchanged.",
      "UIX R6 completes the Android UIX roadmap."
